    "body": "This has a build error, probably you need to add a `data-x-href` in the dependencies section.\r\n\r\nWe've been recently adding attribute change steps to be more rigorous about when attributes change (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1571), but, I think demanding that for the `<link>` section is not necessary at this time. That section already has lots of vaguer \"when the `x` attribute is set\" language. See also https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8138#issuecomment-1198819101.",
