    "body": "It seems this got added in a different place from\r\n\r\n> Whenever the [disabled](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-link-disabled) attribute is removed, set the [link](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-link-element) element's [explicitly enabled](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#explicitly-enabled) attribute to true.\r\n\r\nI think this would end up being confusing for implementers? And presumably we have to also call something when the attribute is removed again?",
